  "plain": "The package no longer ships the concrete-creations brand block (ADR-035: a client's brand lives with the client), so a page with data-brand=\"concrete-creations\" renders the base accent until the app compiles its own block with brandOverlayCss or its own overlay build, as the storefront already does.",
